# Foiled Ambition (ToAU 24). Naja's trigger. The must-zone var set: the trigger area 3; after a rezone (it clears the
# var) the Timer in the future: the area; the Timer 0: the area plays 3097; its update with option 0; finished:
# completed (Imperial Gold Pieces, the title), the must-zone var and the Timer set.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/3 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventUpdate/3097 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3097
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau FoiledAmbition current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
trigger Naja_Salaheem
finish-if-event
charvar Mission[4][23]mustZone 1
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1
walk 34.7,-6.6,-40
rezone
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
charvar Mission[4][23]Timer 999999999
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1
walk 34.7,-6.6,-40
charvar Mission[4][23]Timer 0
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1
update 3097 option=0
finish
